				<r3d:description language="eng">Swedish National Data Service (SND) is a research data infrastructure designed to assist researchers in preserving, maintaining, and disseminating research data in a secure and sustainable manner. The SND Search function makes it easy to find, use, and cite research data from a variety of scientific disciplines. Together with an extensive network of almost 40 Swedish higher education institutions and other research organisations, SND works for increased access to research data, nationally as well as internationally.</r3d:description>
